flowchart LR
    H[older entries] --> S[Compaction summary]
    K[recent entries] --> C[next context]
    S --> C

    H -. summarized and retained in session log .-> E[firstKeptEntryId]
    E --> K

    T{cut inside large Turn?} -->|no| K
    T -->|yes| P[turn-prefix summary]
    P --> C

    classDef old fill:#ecebe7,stroke:#737b78,color:#0a100f
    classDef summary fill:#fff0ba,stroke:#5d4812,color:#0a100f
    classDef keep fill:#d8f5e8,stroke:#123b31,color:#0a100f
    class H,E old
    class S,P,T summary
    class K,C keep
